            f"<span class='cc-hd-chip'>c &nbsp;{problem.n:,} values</span>"
            "</div></div>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-transfer'>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-transfer-label'>ONE-TIME<br>TRANSFER</div>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-transfer-line'></div>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-arrow'>→</div>"
            "</div>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-node device'>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-icon'>🎮</div>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-label'>Device (GPU)</div>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-items'>"
            f"<span class='cc-hd-chip'>{problem.nnz:,} non-zeros resident</span>"
            "<span class='cc-hd-chip'>x, y solver state</span>"
            "<span class='cc-hd-chip'>All PDHG math runs here</span>"
            "</div></div>"
            "</div>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-why-grid'>"
            "<div class='cc-hd-why'><b>Why once</b><span>PDHG is thousands of steps "
            "against the same A, b, c &mdash; sending them once means no iteration "
